(1440521, 186927, 35548, '<td valign="top">Artisticlly, the diagonal of the construction equipment is so strong it is actiing like a wall to stop the  view of the background.  Area in forground is a bit dark.(shadow area on the ground has no detail) better exposure  in the camera may help but you may have eliminated this problem in processing.</td>', 'Artisticlly, the diagonal of the construction equipment is so strong it is actiing like a wall to stop the  view of the background.  Area in forground is a bit dark.(shadow area on the ground has no detail) better exposure  in the camera may help but you may have eliminated this problem in processing.', '2005-06-08 08:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1440524, 186848, 35548, '<td valign="top">Hot spot created by sun is a big problem as is the focus +exposure...<br/> <br/>Simple basic rule to get the image working for you technically at the camera levels is to shoot with the Sun to your back...this would help on the basic level and you will see a big difference in your exposures almost without thinking about them.</td>', 'Hot spot created by sun is a big problem as is the focus +exposure... Simple basic rule to get the image working for you technically at the camera levels is to shoot with the Sun to your back...this would help on the basic level and you will see a big difference in your exposures almost without thinking about them.', '2005-06-08 08:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
