(1441992, 184886, 38639, '<td valign="top">I like this one because I think it can be symbolic. It has the construction tearing this person who is at peace and getting a massage. Or it can be the split between commercialism and how things really are.  And the title makes me think "Beautification" hmmm reminds me of how people, and a lot of women, are trying to look "pretty" but it is destructive and changes you, remakes you.<br/></td>', 'I like this one because I think it can be symbolic. It has the construction tearing this person who is at peace and getting a massage. Or it can be the split between commercialism and how things really are.  And the title makes me think "Beautification" hmmm reminds me of how people, and a lot of women, are trying to look "pretty" but it is destructive and changes you, remakes you.', '2005-06-08 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1);
