(1442021, 186808, 38639, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the title! "The Oracle" and then on the sign it says "Lane Closures Ahead." If it weren''t for the title I wouldn''t have had such a solid idea of what you mean. I figure that this is kind of stating that the end is near. Or that we''re going to have to change our ways and get out of our cars and walk. Really cool idea.</td>', 'Oh I love the title! "The Oracle" and then on the sign it says "Lane Closures Ahead." If it weren''t for the title I wouldn''t have had such a solid idea of what you mean. I figure that this is kind of stating that the end is near. Or that we''re going to have to change our ways and get out of our cars and walk. Really cool idea.', '2005-06-08 19:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
