(1442265, 184769, 29009, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this shot - it is one of the few times I''ve seen a picture of a toy that worked.  Nice detail in the sand.  The color yellow looks a bit flat, but the composition is great.  Overall, this is a very good shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on this shot - it is one of the few times I''ve seen a picture of a toy that worked.  Nice detail in the sand.  The color yellow looks a bit flat, but the composition is great.  Overall, this is a very good shot.', '2005-06-08 20:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
