(1443297, 186855, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good moment you caught here but the car is drawing too much attention IMHO, if you would have moved to the right slightly I would have liked it better but still pretty good, a great candid shot.</td>', 'Good moment you caught here but the car is drawing too much attention IMHO, if you would have moved to the right slightly I would have liked it better but still pretty good, a great candid shot.', '2005-06-09 09:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
