(1443307, 186808, 27482, '<td valign="top">Brilliant title, one of the funniest I have seen in a long time and it took me a second to get it.  However, this is a photography contest and this one is not bad at all, but the image quality is pretty awful, the colour noise in the shot is very bad and it kind of ruins it for me personally, if the image quality had been good I probably would have given it a 7 or even 8.</td>', 'Brilliant title, one of the funniest I have seen in a long time and it took me a second to get it.  However, this is a photography contest and this one is not bad at all, but the image quality is pretty awful, the colour noise in the shot is very bad and it kind of ruins it for me personally, if the image quality had been good I probably would have given it a 7 or even 8.', '2005-06-09 09:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
