(1443727, 186951, 18868, '<td valign="top">This is one of those "almost great" images -- great idea, the execution is almost there, but the lighting needs to focus more attention to the nail stick, and fully light them.  Good use of DOF.</td>', 'This is one of those "almost great" images -- great idea, the execution is almost there, but the lighting needs to focus more attention to the nail stick, and fully light them.  Good use of DOF.', '2005-06-09 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443729, 186852, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but in my opinion I would have preferred this if it were not so tightly framed, it´s hard to get a context of where she and the dog are standing as it is now.  What I am trying to say is that IMHO you need to show if she 100 stories up or is this just a threshold, do you know what I mean?  Also the lighting is good but the flash shadow is never good to have so I deducted 1 point for that.<br/> <br/>All in all a very good idea but not executed as I would have preferred it.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Not a bad idea but in my opinion I would have preferred this if it were not so tightly framed, it´s hard to get a context of where she and the dog are standing as it is now.  What I am trying to say is that IMHO you need to show if she 100 stories up or is this just a threshold, do you know what I mean?  Also the lighting is good but the flash shadow is never good to have so I deducted 1 point for that. All in all a very good idea but not executed as I would have preferred it.  Keep up the good work!', '2005-06-09 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
