(1444025, 186830, 38418, '<td valign="top">Focus is off to me</td>', 'Focus is off to me', '2005-06-09 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444026, 184707, 38418, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how it meets the challenge and think the focus is too soft on the flower</td>', 'I don''t see how it meets the challenge and think the focus is too soft on the flower', '2005-06-09 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444028, 184714, 38418, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I can''t make the connection to the challenge because the focus is off</td>', 'Sorry but I can''t make the connection to the challenge because the focus is off', '2005-06-09 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444035, 185368, 33249, '<td valign="top">nothing is in focus</td>', 'nothing is in focus', '2005-06-09 15:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444036, 186883, 38418, '<td valign="top">Exposure and color don''t work for me</td>', 'Exposure and color don''t work for me', '2005-06-09 16:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444039, 186377, 38418, '<td valign="top">Focus is off</td>', 'Focus is off', '2005-06-09 16:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444042, 186845, 33249, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but I''m not sure where the actual construction is.</td>', 'I like the picture, but I''m not sure where the actual construction is.', '2005-06-09 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444084, 186589, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think there are too many elements in this picture. An eye is wandering for a while but it doesn''t find any particular point. If the photo would have taken closer to the person and so that the other half of his face would have been in the photo the picture would have got a meaning.</td>', 'I think there are too many elements in this picture. An eye is wandering for a while but it doesn''t find any particular point. If the photo would have taken closer to the person and so that the other half of his face would have been in the photo the picture would have got a meaning.', '2005-06-09 16:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444094, 186941, 35741, '<td valign="top">Strange colours make a mystical atmosphere to this picture. I like  the wholeness, but it would have even been better without so tight cropping. Another time of a day wouldn''t have caused, perhaps, so dark shadows.</td>', 'Strange colours make a mystical atmosphere to this picture. I like  the wholeness, but it would have even been better without so tight cropping. Another time of a day wouldn''t have caused, perhaps, so dark shadows.', '2005-06-09 16:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444099, 186943, 35741, '<td valign="top">A bit too unbalanced composition. The left edge of the card house should have been included. But, however, I like both the idea and the feeling of this picture.</td>', 'A bit too unbalanced composition. The left edge of the card house should have been included. But, however, I like both the idea and the feeling of this picture.', '2005-06-09 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444102, 185987, 35741, '<td valign="top">A worker is a main point in this picture, not the construction. Maybe the focusing should have been opposite.</td>', 'A worker is a main point in this picture, not the construction. Maybe the focusing should have been opposite.', '2005-06-09 16:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444103, 186870, 38838, '<td valign="top">off subject?</td>', 'off subject?', '2005-06-09 16:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444106, 186806, 35741, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I like these kind of silhouette pictures, but this particular one is maybe a bit too unbalanced. Something to the top left; aeroplane or its wake, bird etc.</td>', 'Hmmm... I like these kind of silhouette pictures, but this particular one is maybe a bit too unbalanced. Something to the top left; aeroplane or its wake, bird etc.', '2005-06-09 16:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444107, 185772, 20068, '<td valign="top">The first one I looked at in the challenge and you have set the bar pretty high.  Very creative.</td>', 'The first one I looked at in the challenge and you have set the bar pretty high.  Very creative.', '2005-06-09 16:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444110, 186861, 20068, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  The rusty beams, water and reflection really work together.</td>', 'Neat shot.  The rusty beams, water and reflection really work together.', '2005-06-09 16:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444112, 186200, 4517, '<td valign="top">The colour is excellent.9</td>', 'The colour is excellent.9', '2005-06-09 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444114, 186941, 20068, '<td valign="top">THAT''S IT? $600K, sign me up.  The scaffold and roof line give this a bit of a lean and I would have like to see the sepia toned down just a bit, but good challenge entry.</td>', 'THAT''S IT? $600K, sign me up.  The scaffold and roof line give this a bit of a lean and I would have like to see the sepia toned down just a bit, but good challenge entry.', '2005-06-09 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444115, 186921, 36397, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. My main comment concerns the almost perfect diagonal position of the crane. I think the picture would be better from a slighty different angle which would give more depth.</td>', 'Nice colors. My main comment concerns the almost perfect diagonal position of the crane. I think the picture would be better from a slighty different angle which would give more depth.', '2005-06-09 16:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444116, 186585, 20068, '<td valign="top">The "Where''s Waldo" for the DP set.  Nice and fun.</td>', 'The "Where''s Waldo" for the DP set.  Nice and fun.', '2005-06-09 16:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444118, 184707, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good colour but to central and could be sharper.</td>', 'Good colour but to central and could be sharper.', '2005-06-09 16:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444119, 185205, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit too messy picture. A bigger aperture would have made the closiest objects softer. A little improvement would also have been if there would have been more space up. The look of a worker faces the edge of a pic too soon.</td>', 'I think this is a bit too messy picture. A bigger aperture would have made the closiest objects softer. A little improvement would also have been if there would have been more space up. The look of a worker faces the edge of a pic too soon.', '2005-06-09 16:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444121, 184958, 20068, '<td valign="top">Very strong B&amp;W shot in tone and composition.  Staged or candid?  I can''t tell, which is good either way.</td>', 'Very strong B&W shot in tone and composition.  Staged or candid?  I can''t tell, which is good either way.', '2005-06-09 16:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444123, 185713, 20068, '<td valign="top">ANother great B&amp;W shot.  This reminds me a little of those classic images on the men working on the Empire State Building.  You really captured this guy''s hard work.</td>', 'ANother great B&W shot.  This reminds me a little of those classic images on the men working on the Empire State Building.  You really captured this guy''s hard work.', '2005-06-09 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444125, 186411, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good shot &amp; I like the composition - it''s just way off balance with regard to horizontal.  Had you corrected/straightened it up, I would have scored it much higher.  I know that sometimes shots are taken askew on purpose to add to the effect or mood of the image, but I didn''t get that feeling here.  Still, as I said, I do like the shot - it just needs a little straightening (IMHO).  (5)</td>', 'Good shot & I like the composition - it''s just way off balance with regard to horizontal.  Had you corrected/straightened it up, I would have scored it much higher.  I know that sometimes shots are taken askew on purpose to add to the effect or mood of the image, but I didn''t get that feeling here.  Still, as I said, I do like the shot - it just needs a little straightening (IMHO).  (5)', '2005-06-09 16:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444126, 184886, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be more succesful in some other competitions. It is very skilfully constructed but the woman is the main object, not the building.</td>', 'I think this photo would be more succesful in some other competitions. It is very skilfully constructed but the woman is the main object, not the building.', '2005-06-09 16:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444128, 186875, 20068, '<td valign="top">Just got back from MOMA in NYC and this reminds me of something I would have seen there.  Nice job.  I think this is my favorite, so far.</td>', 'Just got back from MOMA in NYC and this reminds me of something I would have seen there.  Nice job.  I think this is my favorite, so far.', '2005-06-09 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444129, 185205, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good shot - I like the image.  It seems a little askew/crooked with regard to true horizontal though (IMHO).  It is also pretty grainy.  I would have scored it much higher if those two issues had been addressed, but as I said, I still like the composition a lot. (5)</td>', 'Good shot - I like the image.  It seems a little askew/crooked with regard to true horizontal though (IMHO).  It is also pretty grainy.  I would have scored it much higher if those two issues had been addressed, but as I said, I still like the composition a lot. (5)', '2005-06-09 16:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444149, 186886, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be succesful in some other competitions. A skillful usage of wideangle, dramatic composition and strong colours. I like this pic a lot but I find no construction in it.</td>', 'I think this photo would be succesful in some other competitions. A skillful usage of wideangle, dramatic composition and strong colours. I like this pic a lot but I find no construction in it.', '2005-06-09 17:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444190, 186010, 6349, '<td valign="top">good subject.  reminds me of a dinosaur.</td>', 'good subject.  reminds me of a dinosaur.', '2005-06-09 17:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
