(1444527, 186649, 23053, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photo for a while now, and I can''t put my finger on how I feel about it.  On one hand, I like certain aspects, like the complimentary colors, but I am undecided about the composition.  Something seems lacking, almost out of balance to me.  Honestly, this shot held my attention, which is more than many can say.  Good luck...sorry I couldn''t be more insightful.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photo for a while now, and I can''t put my finger on how I feel about it.  On one hand, I like certain aspects, like the complimentary colors, but I am undecided about the composition.  Something seems lacking, almost out of balance to me.  Honestly, this shot held my attention, which is more than many can say.  Good luck...sorry I couldn''t be more insightful.', '2005-06-09 19:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444531, 185554, 36701, '<td valign="top">great pic.</td>', 'great pic.', '2005-06-09 19:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444533, 186811, 23053, '<td valign="top">This should do well, either because of or in spite of it going against conventional thought on what comprises construction.  The real winning aspect of this shot is of course the beautiful shapes and repetition.</td>', 'This should do well, either because of or in spite of it going against conventional thought on what comprises construction.  The real winning aspect of this shot is of course the beautiful shapes and repetition.', '2005-06-09 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444536, 185086, 23053, '<td valign="top">This shot looks slightly over-saturated.  I like the subject matter, but feel this is more along the lines of something you''d see in a newspaper over an art house.  If that was your goal, congratulations.</td>', 'This shot looks slightly over-saturated.  I like the subject matter, but feel this is more along the lines of something you''d see in a newspaper over an art house.  If that was your goal, congratulations.', '2005-06-09 19:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1444538, 184579, 36701, '<td valign="top">the building in the bottom right distracts from the picture. i like the photo otherwise.</td>', 'the building in the bottom right distracts from the picture. i like the photo otherwise.', '2005-06-09 19:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
