(1445148, 186943, 38072, '<td valign="top">Building a house of cards!  fun!  Sorry to mention this, but the very first thing I noticed in this shot is the dirt under the fingernail.  It might have been neat to see more of the house and less hands too (although this is more Constructions than Constructed, so I guess that''s good).  5</td>', 'Building a house of cards!  fun!  Sorry to mention this, but the very first thing I noticed in this shot is the dirt under the fingernail.  It might have been neat to see more of the house and less hands too (although this is more Constructions than Constructed, so I guess that''s good).  5', '2005-06-10 01:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445149, 186479, 35379, '<td valign="top">Good use of color &amp; composition! Very Creative!</td>', 'Good use of color & composition! Very Creative!', '2005-06-10 01:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445151, 186848, 38072, '<td valign="top">A good idea -- I like the sun shining over the roof.  I would have rated it higher if it were in focus better and it were closer to being level.  4</td>', 'A good idea -- I like the sun shining over the roof.  I would have rated it higher if it were in focus better and it were closer to being level.  4', '2005-06-10 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445152, 185181, 38072, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice here is the sharp focus.  The contrast of the rock and the wood is nice.  7</td>', 'First thing I notice here is the sharp focus.  The contrast of the rock and the wood is nice.  7', '2005-06-10 01:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445153, 186853, 38072, '<td valign="top">Wow... that looks like a mess from this angle!  5</td>', 'Wow... that looks like a mess from this angle!  5', '2005-06-10 01:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445154, 185279, 38072, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why this doesn''t jump out at me -- the sign sure does.  I like the contrast of the orange on green.  It kinda leaves the construction to the imagination though.  5</td>', 'I''m not sure why this doesn''t jump out at me -- the sign sure does.  I like the contrast of the orange on green.  It kinda leaves the construction to the imagination though.  5', '2005-06-10 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445155, 185342, 38072, '<td valign="top">Seems like there''s too much sky.  Definitely some construction going on though!  5</td>', 'Seems like there''s too much sky.  Definitely some construction going on though!  5', '2005-06-10 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445156, 184942, 38072, '<td valign="top">A mass of cranes!  There''s no real focal point that I can latch onto.  5</td>', 'A mass of cranes!  There''s no real focal point that I can latch onto.  5', '2005-06-10 01:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445157, 185933, 38072, '<td valign="top">Construction?  or Destruction?!  I guess it''s usually a little of both.  I like this shot -- makes me want to jump out of the way.  7</td>', 'Construction?  or Destruction?!  I guess it''s usually a little of both.  I like this shot -- makes me want to jump out of the way.  7', '2005-06-10 01:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445159, 185956, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like the crane on the distant building.  Seems like the cable or whatever it is in the foreground is in the way.  I''d rate this higher without that.  5</td>', 'I like the crane on the distant building.  Seems like the cable or whatever it is in the foreground is in the way.  I''d rate this higher without that.  5', '2005-06-10 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445160, 186139, 38072, '<td valign="top">How much did you do to the clouds on this shot?  It looks like the color''s been altered to me.  It definitely caught my eye though.  6</td>', 'How much did you do to the clouds on this shot?  It looks like the color''s been altered to me.  It definitely caught my eye though.  6', '2005-06-10 01:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445163, 186479, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but it looks a little *too* blurred to me.  It also doesn''t look level.  7 for the shot -1 for a little too much blur for my liking and the tilt.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but it looks a little *too* blurred to me.  It also doesn''t look level.  7 for the shot -1 for a little too much blur for my liking and the tilt.', '2005-06-10 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445165, 184469, 38072, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, and I''m not sure what I''m looking at -- is this a kind-of dome at the entrance to a building?  5</td>', 'I don''t get the title, and I''m not sure what I''m looking at -- is this a kind-of dome at the entrance to a building?  5', '2005-06-10 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445166, 185618, 38072, '<td valign="top">Was this illuminated by a fire on the beach?  it''s a nice shot  I like the orange lighting against the blue background.  7</td>', 'Was this illuminated by a fire on the beach?  it''s a nice shot  I like the orange lighting against the blue background.  7', '2005-06-10 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445167, 186594, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice and refreshing take on the topic. TEchinically well executed too. (8)</td>', 'Very nice and refreshing take on the topic. TEchinically well executed too. (8)', '2005-06-10 01:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445169, 184900, 38072, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at here.  If I knew what it was, maybe it would say Construction to me.  Sorry, but I''m not seeing it.  3</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at here.  If I knew what it was, maybe it would say Construction to me.  Sorry, but I''m not seeing it.  3', '2005-06-10 01:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445175, 186956, 38072, '<td valign="top">I wish the picture were larger.  I see construction, but it would be a lot cooler if I could see more silhouette of construction equipment and less of the hillside.  4</td>', 'I wish the picture were larger.  I see construction, but it would be a lot cooler if I could see more silhouette of construction equipment and less of the hillside.  4', '2005-06-10 01:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445176, 184886, 7531, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2005-06-10 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445177, 186910, 38072, '<td valign="top">I hope the house being built is straighter than that pile of bricks.  5</td>', 'I hope the house being built is straighter than that pile of bricks.  5', '2005-06-10 01:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445179, 184886, 37103, '<td valign="top">My favorite image so far.  Nice suble soft colors on the poster and then the hard lines and bright yellow of the construction behind make this image incredibly compelling.  If it were possible to completely cut out the glimpse of wall at the bottom it might be even more unearthly.  10.</td>', 'My favorite image so far.  Nice suble soft colors on the poster and then the hard lines and bright yellow of the construction behind make this image incredibly compelling.  If it were possible to completely cut out the glimpse of wall at the bottom it might be even more unearthly.  10.', '2005-06-10 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445181, 185891, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of old versus new.  Nice perspective lends the image a nice symbolism, like old and new come together in the distance.  I don''t find the white in the center too distracting although it would be nice to minimize it more if possible, especially the area on the water. 9.</td>', 'I love the contrast of old versus new.  Nice perspective lends the image a nice symbolism, like old and new come together in the distance.  I don''t find the white in the center too distracting although it would be nice to minimize it more if possible, especially the area on the water. 9.', '2005-06-10 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445184, 186494, 7570, '<td valign="top">oh darn, he does look tired with his head tilt down</td>', 'oh darn, he does look tired with his head tilt down', '2005-06-10 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445189, 186876, 37103, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Beautiful tones, love the sepia here.  Nice angle you chose to view him from.  I love that his is about to take off his hat and his face is hidden.  In the top three I hope.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Beautiful tones, love the sepia here.  Nice angle you chose to view him from.  I love that his is about to take off his hat and his face is hidden.  In the top three I hope.', '2005-06-10 01:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445190, 185971, 7570, '<td valign="top">Madagascar is a nice cartoon!</td>', 'Madagascar is a nice cartoon!', '2005-06-10 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445192, 186808, 7570, '<td valign="top">too much noise in the photo.interesting positioning tho. 5</td>', 'too much noise in the photo.interesting positioning tho. 5', '2005-06-10 01:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445193, 185713, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action oriented shot.  I love that we seemed to be perched high up with him.  The look on his face is intent and wonderful, you captured the perfect moment.  Man and machine.  The black and white was a great choice.</td>', 'Wonderful action oriented shot.  I love that we seemed to be perched high up with him.  The look on his face is intent and wonderful, you captured the perfect moment.  Man and machine.  The black and white was a great choice.', '2005-06-10 01:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445195, 186901, 7570, '<td valign="top">good use of DOF here.</td>', 'good use of DOF here.', '2005-06-10 01:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445196, 186847, 35530, '<td valign="top">That one guy looks like he is ready to throw a rock at you. Nice capture.</td>', 'That one guy looks like he is ready to throw a rock at you. Nice capture.', '2005-06-10 01:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445199, 186845, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, unfortunely I can''t link it to construction.  At least not any more than I can link any man made structure.  Is the bridge under construction?</td>', 'Beautiful image, unfortunely I can''t link it to construction.  At least not any more than I can link any man made structure.  Is the bridge under construction?', '2005-06-10 01:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445200, 186907, 7531, '<td valign="top">Perspctive is off, and as it is it needs straightening</td>', 'Perspctive is off, and as it is it needs straightening', '2005-06-10 01:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445202, 186168, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image.  I love the perspecive, the light at the end of the tunnel the bright colors to the right.  Sadly it just does not work in this challenge.  It falls into the category of construction only as much as any man made infrastructure does.</td>', 'This is an awesome image.  I love the perspecive, the light at the end of the tunnel the bright colors to the right.  Sadly it just does not work in this challenge.  It falls into the category of construction only as much as any man made infrastructure does.', '2005-06-10 01:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445204, 186232, 35530, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I would have liked more detail instead of a silhouette. There is too much mass with this building so overall it is a little too dark for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I would have liked more detail instead of a silhouette. There is too much mass with this building so overall it is a little too dark for my taste.', '2005-06-10 01:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445206, 186892, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of viewing the construction behind the fence,  Here I think the depth of field is a little distracting.  I might prefer seeing the construction in focus and the fence somehwhat fuzzy.</td>', 'I like the concept of viewing the construction behind the fence,  Here I think the depth of field is a little distracting.  I might prefer seeing the construction in focus and the fence somehwhat fuzzy.', '2005-06-10 01:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445209, 185594, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-06-10 01:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445213, 186038, 7570, '<td valign="top">interesting. an 8 for being creative and captured the "moment" (unless you parked them as such yourself)</td>', 'interesting. an 8 for being creative and captured the "moment" (unless you parked them as such yourself)', '2005-06-10 01:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
