(1446333, 186429, 24169, '<td valign="top">Well it is an interesting photo but I can''t help thinking it could have been composed a little better. Perhaps even try a black and white or sepia tone to take out the harsher colours. Also the sign in the top LH corner is distracting.</td>', 'Well it is an interesting photo but I can''t help thinking it could have been composed a little better. Perhaps even try a black and white or sepia tone to take out the harsher colours. Also the sign in the top LH corner is distracting.', '2005-06-10 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446339, 184581, 24169, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge and I particularly like the idea. I also love the range of colours you captured in this photograph. This photo held my attention. Well done!</td>', 'A different take on the challenge and I particularly like the idea. I also love the range of colours you captured in this photograph. This photo held my attention. Well done!', '2005-06-10 17:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446346, 186488, 24169, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colours and nice shadows captured. I don''t like the lines at the bottom of the photo as they seem distracting.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colours and nice shadows captured. I don''t like the lines at the bottom of the photo as they seem distracting.', '2005-06-10 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446353, 186128, 24169, '<td valign="top">Fairly well composed and nice framework with the dark trees and the roof. The red and white striped roof at the bottom is a subtracts from the photo IMO.</td>', 'Fairly well composed and nice framework with the dark trees and the roof. The red and white striped roof at the bottom is a subtracts from the photo IMO.', '2005-06-10 17:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446355, 185368, 24169, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. A tighter crop may have improved it.</td>', 'Interesting photo. A tighter crop may have improved it.', '2005-06-10 17:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446361, 185208, 24169, '<td valign="top">Well this is definitely a different type of construction! Good idea and well executed. I like the colours you captured and also the focus.</td>', 'Well this is definitely a different type of construction! Good idea and well executed. I like the colours you captured and also the focus.', '2005-06-10 17:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
