(1447636, 186625, 31319, '<td valign="top">Good clarity.  Maybe just a touch more contrast to bring out the workers?  Overall excellent submission for this challenge.</td>', 'Good clarity.  Maybe just a touch more contrast to bring out the workers?  Overall excellent submission for this challenge.', '2005-06-11 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
