(1447862, 186876, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nearly everything involved in construction is shown in this well-crafted shot! Including the exhaustion from another day of tying rebar. Beautiful work with a high pixel camera and each pixel is used wonderfully. One of my picks to ribbon.</td>', 'Nearly everything involved in construction is shown in this well-crafted shot! Including the exhaustion from another day of tying rebar. Beautiful work with a high pixel camera and each pixel is used wonderfully. One of my picks to ribbon.', '2005-06-11 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1447868, 185713, 30817, '<td valign="top">Fortunately the title is the only thing wrong with this photograph and that can be easily fixed.  This is an outstanding slice of construction work frozen in time. The results of this man''s labor is implied by the finished building in the BG. The casual backward hat and extreme body posture, as well as the careworn face all add up to a scene any professional photographer would love to display in an exhibition. My Blue pick for the week and will add to my favorites. Congratulations.</td>', 'Fortunately the title is the only thing wrong with this photograph and that can be easily fixed.  This is an outstanding slice of construction work frozen in time. The results of this man''s labor is implied by the finished building in the BG. The casual backward hat and extreme body posture, as well as the careworn face all add up to a scene any professional photographer would love to display in an exhibition. My Blue pick for the week and will add to my favorites. Congratulations.', '2005-06-11 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1447878, 186676, 33114, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful picture. I like rusty old things a lot. Allthough I do not quite see the connection with the challenge title I can really appreciate the image.  It would have been my personal winner so far. Still an eight.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful picture. I like rusty old things a lot. Allthough I do not quite see the connection with the challenge title I can really appreciate the image.  It would have been my personal winner so far. Still an eight.', '2005-06-11 17:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
