(1450875, 185176, 19831, '<td valign="top">To me, shots of ''toys'' are usually not very appealing. However, this photo I think is executed brilliantly. Technically, lighting, focus etc. - great. The composition is wonderful, uncluttered, purposeful, pleasing to view. The pose and ''expression'' on the toy are great. Oh, did you get a model release? hehehe. I like the black background, it really works well here. I think what really ties the whole thing together and makes it really work for me is of course, the hammer.  Very refreshing, I quite like the photo. Very nice job.</td>', 'To me, shots of ''toys'' are usually not very appealing. However, this photo I think is executed brilliantly. Technically, lighting, focus etc. - great. The composition is wonderful, uncluttered, purposeful, pleasing to view. The pose and ''expression'' on the toy are great. Oh, did you get a model release? hehehe. I like the black background, it really works well here. I think what really ties the whole thing together and makes it really work for me is of course, the hammer.  Very refreshing, I quite like the photo. Very nice job.', '2005-06-13 06:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450884, 185656, 19831, '<td valign="top">Is this a poll? I vote for extra-terrestrial communication devices ! <br/>:-P</td>', 'Is this a poll? I vote for extra-terrestrial communication devices ! :-P', '2005-06-13 06:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450940, 186579, 29474, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting.', '2005-06-13 06:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450956, 184714, 35322, '<td valign="top">too small and way out of focus</td>', 'too small and way out of focus', '2005-06-13 06:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450960, 185431, 35322, '<td valign="top">not on focus</td>', 'not on focus', '2005-06-13 06:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
