(1452684, 185674, 35804, '<td valign="top">After looking at SO many crane images...this is by far the best and most interesting in my opinion. The B &amp; W and the grain are so effective...a very moody urban scene...but what totally makes this image is that sign...so simple but adds so much interest...nicely done.</td>', 'After looking at SO many crane images...this is by far the best and most interesting in my opinion. The B & W and the grain are so effective...a very moody urban scene...but what totally makes this image is that sign...so simple but adds so much interest...nicely done.', '2005-06-13 17:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1452693, 186804, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is such a strong image...beautiful light and shadow...very striking.</td>', 'This is such a strong image...beautiful light and shadow...very striking.', '2005-06-13 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
