(1454587, 186811, 36981, '<td valign="top">I was surprised that I like this as much as I do.  I clicked on the thumbnail expecting to dismiss it as another stack of cards (which I saw so many of during Triangle), but I think you did a really good job on this.  The light &amp; shadows are wonderful, I like the blue color and the white background, and the crop is good as well.  It definitely held my interest.  Good job!</td>', 'I was surprised that I like this as much as I do.  I clicked on the thumbnail expecting to dismiss it as another stack of cards (which I saw so many of during Triangle), but I think you did a really good job on this.  The light & shadows are wonderful, I like the blue color and the white background, and the crop is good as well.  It definitely held my interest.  Good job!', '2005-06-14 11:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
