(1454594, 185687, 36981, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I''m finding as I vote that I really appreciate the pictures with people in them, especially since it seems to be less of a norm than I had supposed it would.  The colors &amp; composition here are strong, and it''s an interesting moment.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this.  I''m finding as I vote that I really appreciate the pictures with people in them, especially since it seems to be less of a norm than I had supposed it would.  The colors & composition here are strong, and it''s an interesting moment.  Well done!', '2005-06-14 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
