(1454623, 184880, 31403, '<td valign="top">the vertical lines aren''t vertical.  I would straighten them up, or try really cranking them to produce some triangles and add some energy and drama</td>', 'the vertical lines aren''t vertical.  I would straighten them up, or try really cranking them to produce some triangles and add some energy and drama', '2005-06-14 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454624, 186010, 39111, '<td valign="top">I love the Claw.  The rock it''s lifting lacks detail and is out of focus it seems.    The green in the foilage is nice.  Nice balance.</td>', 'I love the Claw.  The rock it''s lifting lacks detail and is out of focus it seems.    The green in the foilage is nice.  Nice balance.', '2005-06-14 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454625, 185973, 39100, '<td valign="top">I''d put more "empty air" above the panes to enhance that that would be the future postion of the skyscraper.</td>', 'I''d put more "empty air" above the panes to enhance that that would be the future postion of the skyscraper.', '2005-06-14 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454626, 186804, 39100, '<td valign="top">Wow..... nice composition!</td>', 'Wow..... nice composition!', '2005-06-14 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454628, 186757, 39100, '<td valign="top">It sure looks high!!!</td>', 'It sure looks high!!!', '2005-06-14 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454630, 186474, 39111, '<td valign="top">I like the red...otherwise nothing in the shot really draws me in.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field would have given the crane even more draw.</td>', 'I like the red...otherwise nothing in the shot really draws me in.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field would have given the crane even more draw.', '2005-06-14 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454631, 186418, 39100, '<td valign="top">A little unsharp....</td>', 'A little unsharp....', '2005-06-14 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454633, 186750, 35804, '<td valign="top">Definitetly one of the more interesting images in the challenge, thanks inpart to the mural...I love the colors, the contrasts...nicely seen.</td>', 'Definitetly one of the more interesting images in the challenge, thanks inpart to the mural...I love the colors, the contrasts...nicely seen.', '2005-06-14 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454635, 186923, 39100, '<td valign="top">A little to much contrast....</td>', 'A little to much contrast....', '2005-06-14 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454636, 186864, 35804, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking detail and perspective...the light is so nice, wonderful depth. I also like your choice of B &amp; W...I am sure this would not have the same effect in color...very nice.</td>', 'Breathtaking detail and perspective...the light is so nice, wonderful depth. I also like your choice of B & W...I am sure this would not have the same effect in color...very nice.', '2005-06-14 11:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454642, 186550, 39111, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I''m a softie for close-ups of wood and old nails :)  The contrast of the nails is nice too, gives the shot a much higher level of eye appeal.  Nice balance and hue/color choice.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I''m a softie for close-ups of wood and old nails :)  The contrast of the nails is nice too, gives the shot a much higher level of eye appeal.  Nice balance and hue/color choice.', '2005-06-14 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454644, 186939, 39111, '<td valign="top">The sky is quite bright and for me, drowns out the subject.  Is the "giant" in focus?</td>', 'The sky is quite bright and for me, drowns out the subject.  Is the "giant" in focus?', '2005-06-14 11:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454645, 186723, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really love the light and textures of this image...the choice to go B &amp; W is also quite nice and very effective. The only thing I am a little bothered by is that the entire image seems to be slightly out of focus...still a very nice image...nicely seen.</td>', 'I really love the light and textures of this image...the choice to go B & W is also quite nice and very effective. The only thing I am a little bothered by is that the entire image seems to be slightly out of focus...still a very nice image...nicely seen.', '2005-06-14 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454653, 185408, 39111, '<td valign="top">wow! that is some green grass, almost unnatural looking (not saying it''s not natural, just saying it looks almost unnatural).  I''m assuming there is wiring in the fence (between the posts) but I can''t see it, though I''d like to.   I like the contrast of this farm set in what looks like suburbia and assume this is what you mean by your title?</td>', 'wow! that is some green grass, almost unnatural looking (not saying it''s not natural, just saying it looks almost unnatural).  I''m assuming there is wiring in the fence (between the posts) but I can''t see it, though I''d like to.   I like the contrast of this farm set in what looks like suburbia and assume this is what you mean by your title?', '2005-06-14 11:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454657, 186232, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love the light and the softness of the sky contrasted again the hard and prickly building. The image has a very nice abstract quality about it, a pleasing composition. I also like the fact you chose to go B &amp; W with this...it emphasizes the light...the contrast between the hard surfaces against the softness of the clouds...well done.</td>', 'I love the light and the softness of the sky contrasted again the hard and prickly building. The image has a very nice abstract quality about it, a pleasing composition. I also like the fact you chose to go B & W with this...it emphasizes the light...the contrast between the hard surfaces against the softness of the clouds...well done.', '2005-06-14 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454658, 185409, 39111, '<td valign="top">The stone wall helps some, but I''m still a little bored by the composition of this shot.</td>', 'The stone wall helps some, but I''m still a little bored by the composition of this shot.', '2005-06-14 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454660, 186444, 37923, '<td valign="top">Very good picture!!</td>', 'Very good picture!!', '2005-06-14 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454661, 185618, 39111, '<td valign="top">awww, I like this a lot.  the wood is so warm and the child is just perfectly balanced.  the cross just adds to it as well.  where did you take this?  it looks a bit grainy?  was it getting dark out with a long exposure?</td>', 'awww, I like this a lot.  the wood is so warm and the child is just perfectly balanced.  the cross just adds to it as well.  where did you take this?  it looks a bit grainy?  was it getting dark out with a long exposure?', '2005-06-14 12:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454662, 186917, 37923, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, very cool!</td>', 'Nice picture, very cool!', '2005-06-14 12:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454664, 186876, 35804, '<td valign="top">This image has a really nice "rough and rugged" quality about it emphasized by the monotone treatment. I really like the high contrast, the textures, the composition...I also like that we can''t see his face...he''s just to tired to sit up straight or even lift his head...nicely done.</td>', 'This image has a really nice "rough and rugged" quality about it emphasized by the monotone treatment. I really like the high contrast, the textures, the composition...I also like that we can''t see his face...he''s just to tired to sit up straight or even lift his head...nicely done.', '2005-06-14 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454671, 186808, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really love the title...as silly as that might sound, but it actually made me like this image more...go figure. I really like the grit and grain of this image, it has a really nice late night feel about it...you''ve captured that ugly ominous yellow glow perfectly.</td>', 'I really love the title...as silly as that might sound, but it actually made me like this image more...go figure. I really like the grit and grain of this image, it has a really nice late night feel about it...you''ve captured that ugly ominous yellow glow perfectly.', '2005-06-14 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454675, 186886, 35804, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a big fan of the tilty view thing, but in this case I really like it! I also really like the wide angle distortion...you have made this huge piece of construction machinery interesting to look at.</td>', 'I''m not usually a big fan of the tilty view thing, but in this case I really like it! I also really like the wide angle distortion...you have made this huge piece of construction machinery interesting to look at.', '2005-06-14 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454680, 186352, 35804, '<td valign="top">The light in this image is absolutely gorgeous! It''s so funny how light can make something so "everyday" look so magnificent. The sheen on the plastic is complete perfection...especially contrasted against the darker blue of the sky...nicely seen.</td>', 'The light in this image is absolutely gorgeous! It''s so funny how light can make something so "everyday" look so magnificent. The sheen on the plastic is complete perfection...especially contrasted against the darker blue of the sky...nicely seen.', '2005-06-14 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454684, 186916, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just love the softness of this image...the light is so ethereal...so quiet and subtle...I can almost feel the heat.</td>', 'I just love the softness of this image...the light is so ethereal...so quiet and subtle...I can almost feel the heat.', '2005-06-14 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454690, 185513, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is such a strange image but totally mesmerizing...I can almost feel that overbearing heat and smell the asphalt...great abstract feel. Such a simple image yet so deep...lush almost...nicely seen.</td>', 'This is such a strange image but totally mesmerizing...I can almost feel that overbearing heat and smell the asphalt...great abstract feel. Such a simple image yet so deep...lush almost...nicely seen.', '2005-06-14 12:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454693, 186480, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great colors! A really nice crisp image...I really like all the"clutter"...but that''s life sometimes...a bunch of clutter.</td>', 'Great colors! A really nice crisp image...I really like all the"clutter"...but that''s life sometimes...a bunch of clutter.', '2005-06-14 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454698, 184893, 39100, '<td valign="top">Is this construction in hell? WOW!!!!</td>', 'Is this construction in hell? WOW!!!!', '2005-06-14 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454705, 186574, 35804, '<td valign="top">I am so envious of the people who live close to the bean!. I swear if it had been there when I lived up there...oh the pictures I would have taken then...anyway...I really like the composition of this image, the perspective the bean creates, and the color is quite nice...I also love the title...it is like we are looking into another dimension.</td>', 'I am so envious of the people who live close to the bean!. I swear if it had been there when I lived up there...oh the pictures I would have taken then...anyway...I really like the composition of this image, the perspective the bean creates, and the color is quite nice...I also love the title...it is like we are looking into another dimension.', '2005-06-14 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454719, 186594, 31524, '<td valign="top">great detail.  And intrepretation of the challenge</td>', 'great detail.  And intrepretation of the challenge', '2005-06-14 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454720, 186823, 35804, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this image the more I like it..the starkness, the texture, the harsh lighting and simplicity....so dank and dirty...the horrors of contruction indeed!</td>', 'The more I look at this image the more I like it..the starkness, the texture, the harsh lighting and simplicity....so dank and dirty...the horrors of contruction indeed!', '2005-06-14 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454724, 186813, 31524, '<td valign="top">not sure how it fits the challenge</td>', 'not sure how it fits the challenge', '2005-06-14 12:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454727, 186818, 35322, '<td valign="top">I would  have liked to see the whole crane and a little bit of this "pre-school"</td>', 'I would  have liked to see the whole crane and a little bit of this "pre-school"', '2005-06-14 12:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454734, 186942, 35322, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but the image is not realy on focus and the light is too strong on the toy</td>', 'interesting idea, but the image is not realy on focus and the light is too strong on the toy', '2005-06-14 12:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454735, 186750, 31524, '<td valign="top">lots of interest in the shot.  Good eye</td>', 'lots of interest in the shot.  Good eye', '2005-06-14 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1454745, 186870, 31524, '<td valign="top">foreground adds color, but its almost too much.</td>', 'foreground adds color, but its almost too much.', '2005-06-14 12:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
