(1454751, 185410, 31524, '<td valign="top">very artsy.  Loved the light in the tube in front, and that it is b&amp;w.  Would suit several challenges.</td>', 'very artsy.  Loved the light in the tube in front, and that it is b&w.  Would suit several challenges.', '2005-06-14 12:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
