(1454785, 185261, 31524, '<td valign="top">was just about to finish voting, but glad I waited.  Love it.  And its flag day today.</td>', 'was just about to finish voting, but glad I waited.  Love it.  And its flag day today.', '2005-06-14 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
