(1456326, 186746, 34134, '<td valign="top">Conga Rats on your top 10 finish!!! Beautiful, artistic rendition.<br/></td>', 'Conga Rats on your top 10 finish!!! Beautiful, artistic rendition.', '2005-06-15 01:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1456330, 185786, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright, listen I was so excited to see how this photo finished.  Me and my wife both, and we were both appaulled to see it not finish at least in the top 10.  I mean still a good place, but I picked it as my only 10 in the contest, along with only 2 9''s, and 6 8''s.  Me and my wife both are convinced that overall the voters are way to shallow.  The only thing i can think of is maybe people didn''t see the construction value in it.  At any rate, congratulations for a fantastic shot, and I am most certain I am not the only one who thinks that.</td>', 'Alright, listen I was so excited to see how this photo finished.  Me and my wife both, and we were both appaulled to see it not finish at least in the top 10.  I mean still a good place, but I picked it as my only 10 in the contest, along with only 2 9''s, and 6 8''s.  Me and my wife both are convinced that overall the voters are way to shallow.  The only thing i can think of is maybe people didn''t see the construction value in it.  At any rate, congratulations for a fantastic shot, and I am most certain I am not the only one who thinks that.', '2005-06-15 01:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1456341, 186876, 29269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to fellow Austinite! What a wonderful way to depict construction without cranes and the rest... this photo tells a story, and does not advertise construction equipment.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your Blue!<br/> <br/>-Serge</td>', 'Congratulations to fellow Austinite! What a wonderful way to depict construction without cranes and the rest... this photo tells a story, and does not advertise construction equipment. Congratulations on your Blue! -Serge', '2005-06-15 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
