(1457408, 185713, 30817, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cwalmye:</b></div><hr/><i> Crap!  I saved over the original file, I hope they don''t take away this ribbon.  I never expected this shot to do so well.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Lesson here: Don''t second guess yourself. You are talented. At some point you hit "enter" because you thought, "I completed it." That fact alone meant it was special.<br/> <br/>You didn''t know you made a classic image in a style reminescent of the great Life magazine photographers? You did. Now ... go ... do it again.</td>', 'Originally posted by cwalmye: Crap!  I saved over the original file, I hope they don''t take away this ribbon.  I never expected this shot to do so well....   Lesson here: Don''t second guess yourself. You are talented. At some point you hit "enter" because you thought, "I completed it." That fact alone meant it was special. You didn''t know you made a classic image in a style reminescent of the great Life magazine photographers? You did. Now ... go ... do it again.', '2005-06-15 10:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
