(1459622, 185559, 38457, '<td valign="top">I sent original file? what the heck, where is the quality control when you need some?<br/>This is an Original Infrared Pure Photograph,<br/>only gave it sepia tone, no other adjustments were done.<br/>This was a 5-6 sec exposure at f5.6 with a Lee gel infrared filter on back/rear of my Canon 17-40mm L series lens. Shot with my lovely Canon EOS 1ds camera.<br/> <br/>thanks for your support.</td>', 'I sent original file? what the heck, where is the quality control when you need some?This is an Original Infrared Pure Photograph,only gave it sepia tone, no other adjustments were done.This was a 5-6 sec exposure at f5.6 with a Lee gel infrared filter on back/rear of my Canon 17-40mm L series lens. Shot with my lovely Canon EOS 1ds camera. thanks for your support.', '2005-06-16 01:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1459739, 186630, 5015, '<td valign="top">241 out of 299 is not really something to be proud of.  It was only my second submission ever.  But now the "bug has bitten" - my wife is as excited about dpchallenge as I am.  We worked together on the submission for "darkness".  I was aiming to break at least the 5 barrier with this one, but as the voting continues it seems as if it is going even better.  Now to get that unique, creative metal shot...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-16 02:22:05.</i></td>', '241 out of 299 is not really something to be proud of.  It was only my second submission ever.  But now the "bug has bitten" - my wife is as excited about dpchallenge as I am.  We worked together on the submission for "darkness".  I was aiming to break at least the 5 barrier with this one, but as the voting continues it seems as if it is going even better.  Now to get that unique, creative metal shot...', '2005-06-16 03:21:18.000000', '2005-06-16 03:22:05.000000', 0),
(1459787, 186792, 28875, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for your comments. Not that happy with this image. Wanted to send a picture of cranes, but glad I didn''t.<br/>Very slowly learning from you guy''s.Thanks.</td>', 'Thank you all very much for your comments. Not that happy with this image. Wanted to send a picture of cranes, but glad I didn''t.Very slowly learning from you guy''s.Thanks.', '2005-06-16 04:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1460141, 186169, 17505, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I know it didn''t exactly meet the challenge, but I went out to find something for the challenge and was coming up with a ton of really boring shots. I threw them all out and decided to put something in that was ''construction'' related but might give viewers something different to look at to break the monotony of orange cones. <br/> <br/>I was really surprised at the excellent photo''s in this challenge. I though voters would be getting sick of similar boring shots, but that wasn''t the case. I loved so many of the shots in this challenge I couldn''t pick a favorite. <br/> <br/>Needless to say, I won''t do this again as it seems to have ticked some people off. I really did feel I was within the outter limits of the challenge. I wasn''t trying to ''test'' people or break the rules...<br/> <br/>Oh well. Live and Learn.</td>', 'Yeah, I know it didn''t exactly meet the challenge, but I went out to find something for the challenge and was coming up with a ton of really boring shots. I threw them all out and decided to put something in that was ''construction'' related but might give viewers something different to look at to break the monotony of orange cones.  I was really surprised at the excellent photo''s in this challenge. I though voters would be getting sick of similar boring shots, but that wasn''t the case. I loved so many of the shots in this challenge I couldn''t pick a favorite.  Needless to say, I won''t do this again as it seems to have ticked some people off. I really did feel I was within the outter limits of the challenge. I wasn''t trying to ''test'' people or break the rules... Oh well. Live and Learn.', '2005-06-16 10:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
