(1462617, 185891, 35547, '<td valign="top">Thx for the comments. It was sunrise and I was shooting directly into the sun. Placed the sun as close to the middle as possible in order to minimize flare and blooming but conditions were harsh to say the least. And yes, I was on a boat. It''s the only way to pull off a shot between the 2 spans.</td>', 'Thx for the comments. It was sunrise and I was shooting directly into the sun. Placed the sun as close to the middle as possible in order to minimize flare and blooming but conditions were harsh to say the least. And yes, I was on a boat. It''s the only way to pull off a shot between the 2 spans.', '2005-06-17 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
