(1488587, 185531, 34247, '<td valign="top">A nice eye to capture this. nice angling and sense of motion. you didn''t list full exif, but i''d wager this would have been more dramatic with a faster shutter speed, freezing the moment even more.</td>', 'A nice eye to capture this. nice angling and sense of motion. you didn''t list full exif, but i''d wager this would have been more dramatic with a faster shutter speed, freezing the moment even more.', '2005-06-28 14:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1498440, 184893, 40102, '<td valign="top">very nice picture</td>', 'very nice picture', '2005-07-01 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1498985, 186605, 13688, '<td valign="top">superb capture.  I wish you had cropped down a bit more.  the extraneous details on the right and bottom do grab too much attention.  his expression says "ssdd"...i would have focused on that...would have given you that elusive top 10</td>', 'superb capture.  I wish you had cropped down a bit more.  the extraneous details on the right and bottom do grab too much attention.  his expression says "ssdd"...i would have focused on that...would have given you that elusive top 10', '2005-07-02 02:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1499463, 186601, 23394, '<td valign="top">ditto what david said...i love the shot.  looks like this could be a great place for you to shoot around.  have fun!<br/> <br/>(and, just in case you haven''t stumbled across this thread, you might find it useful.  you have a good eye and your comments indicate you have the ability to see.  all you need to do is marry up your talent with challenge interpretation, and you''ll do great here!  here''s the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.)</td>', 'ditto what david said...i love the shot.  looks like this could be a great place for you to shoot around.  have fun! (and, just in case you haven''t stumbled across this thread, you might find it useful.  you have a good eye and your comments indicate you have the ability to see.  all you need to do is marry up your talent with challenge interpretation, and you''ll do great here!  here''s the thread.)', '2005-07-02 09:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
