(1524216, 185992, 37544, '<td valign="top">this is funny! I want you to know that I gave it an 8 for creativity!!</td>', 'this is funny! I want you to know that I gave it an 8 for creativity!!', '2005-07-10 22:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524679, 186601, 37544, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this! The curves, the sky, everything. If you had put this in the leading lines challenge you would have gotton GREAT scores. This is a great angle.</td>', 'I love everything about this! The curves, the sky, everything. If you had put this in the leading lines challenge you would have gotton GREAT scores. This is a great angle.', '2005-07-11 00:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1527626, 186550, 3087, '<td valign="top">B/W Mentor Group.<br/> <br/>I do love the textures and lines of worn wood and black and white is always such a good medium for textures and shapes. I like the focal point of hte metal screw too. The composition doesn''t feel quite balanced to me, but I can''t put a finger on why not. What I really like is the range of tones and the play of light and shadow in hte contours of the surfaces.</td>', 'B/W Mentor Group. I do love the textures and lines of worn wood and black and white is always such a good medium for textures and shapes. I like the focal point of hte metal screw too. The composition doesn''t feel quite balanced to me, but I can''t put a finger on why not. What I really like is the range of tones and the play of light and shadow in hte contours of the surfaces.', '2005-07-11 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1528011, 186792, 40604, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic! Love it!</td>', 'Very dramatic! Love it!', '2005-07-11 20:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530666, 186550, 2170, '<td valign="top">B/W Club!<br/> <br/>there are really great textures and lines in this shot.  i like the duotone in it but i think the color should be stronger.  there should be more difference between the light areas and the dark areas of the image, but that''s easy to accomplish.<br/> <br/>compositionally, i think there''s a lot to look at here -- it''s a bit busy.  perhaps a shot of the nail splitting a single board would work better?  but, that''s a discussion for a different mentor.  :)</td>', 'B/W Club! there are really great textures and lines in this shot.  i like the duotone in it but i think the color should be stronger.  there should be more difference between the light areas and the dark areas of the image, but that''s easy to accomplish. compositionally, i think there''s a lot to look at here -- it''s a bit busy.  perhaps a shot of the nail splitting a single board would work better?  but, that''s a discussion for a different mentor.  :)', '2005-07-12 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530938, 186550, 37444, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys. I remember when I was playing with this, I would blowout the lighter screw, so I backed off on the contrast. I see now, that I could have masked that off and increased the contrast/levels on the rest of it :)</td>', 'Thanks guys. I remember when I was playing with this, I would blowout the lighter screw, so I backed off on the contrast. I see now, that I could have masked that off and increased the contrast/levels on the rest of it :)', '2005-07-12 20:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
